			"hadithnumber": 2259,
			"arabicnumber": 2259,
			"text": "It was narrated that Zuhri heard Malik bin Aws bin Hadathan say:\"I heard 'Umar say: \"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ), said: 'Gold for silver is usury, unless it is exchanged on the spot.\"' (Sahih) Abu Bakr bin Abu-Shaibah said: \"I heard sufyan saying: 'Gold for silver.\" memorize (this)",
